        "question_type": "Practical",
        "exam_year": "2005",
        "question_text": "<p>The cash book balance of a business is \u20b512,000 (debit), while the bank statement shows a balance of \u20b510,500 (credit). The following were discovered:<br>- Unpresented cheques: \u20b52,000<br>- Bank charges: \u20b5500<br>- Deposits not yet credited: \u20b51,000<br><br>Calculate the adjusted cash book balance.</p>",
